    "en": {
      "trackName": "Watch Games-Summon the Dragon",
      "description": "In this mysterious oriental waterworld, you'll begin as a tiny tadpole and evolve into a legendary dragon! Each evolution brings new experiences, and every step of growth is filled with surprises.\n\nGame Features:\n• Unique Evolution System - Experience 10 different forms from tadpole to dragon\n• Beautiful Ink Painting Style - Game scenes and characters with oriental aesthetics\n• Dynamic Environment - Floating lotus leaves and rippling water effects create a dreamlike waterworld\n• Immersive Audio - Beautiful background music and dynamic sound effects\n\nInnovative Controls:\n• Digital Crown Control - Elegantly change direction using the Apple Watch crown\n• Touch Gestures - Intuitive four-direction swipe controls for flexible movement\n• Precise Physics Engine - Delivering smooth and realistic gameplay experience\n\nGameplay:\n• Find and consume similar creatures to gain evolution energy\n• Avoid stronger creatures to prevent being eaten\n• Challenge yourself and break records\n\nThe game's difficulty increases gradually, suitable for players of all ages. Perfect for both quick casual play and immersive challenges.\n\nAre you ready to begin this magical evolution journey?\nDownload now and let's explore this vibrant waterworld together!\n\nNote: This game is specially designed for Apple Watch, utilizing watch features for a unique gaming experience.",
      "releaseNotes": "bug fixes",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/watch-games-summon-the-dragon/id6744266001?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "$0.69",
